id: combat-gatherer
name: Combat Gatherer
advancement: true
prerequisite: 5+ Skill Ranks in Clairvoyance
tpCost: 10
# "You may use other Maneuvers without losing your stacks of Lifeforce."
keepsLifeforce: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Other Maneuvers no longer cost your Lifeforce.
text: >
  Combat Gatherer: You’ve learned to hold onto the energy you gather without such intense focus.
  –Prerequisites: 5+ Skill Ranks in Clairvoyance
  –TP Cost: 10
  –Effect: You may use other Maneuvers without losing your stacks of Lifeforce through the effects of Energy Gathering.
